        "The mouse comes first in LatteOS: each of these is also a drop or a row of a card. Win is the Windows key." = "V LatteOS je prvá myš: každá z týchto skratiek je aj kvapka alebo riadok karty. Win je kláves Windows."
        "left button" = "ľavé tlačidlo"
        "right button" = "pravé tlačidlo"
        "The first is the one you type in. With more of them, Win+Space goes to the next." = "Prvým píšeš. Keď ich je viac, Win+medzerník prepne na ďalšie."
