        "A library is missing: {detail}. It can be added to this program's Windows." = "Chýba knižnica: {detail}. Dá sa doplniť do Windowsu tohto programu."
        "The graphics failed. Another way of drawing can be tried." = "Zlyhala grafika. Dá sa skúsiť iný spôsob kreslenia."
        "It asks for its disc. The disc image can be put in as a drive." = "Pýta si svoj disk. Obraz disku sa dá pripojiť ako mechanika."
        "The program crashed." = "Program spadol."
        "Its log names no cause I know." = "V jeho logu nie je príčina, ktorú poznám."
        "What" = "Čo"
        "Will it work" = "Pôjde to"
        "Where and how" = "Kam a ako"
        "Installing" = "Inštalácia"
        "Done" = "Hotovo"
        "What are we installing?" = "Čo inštalujeme?"
        "Show me the disc images, the installer or the folder. Nothing of it is changed." = "Ukáž mi obrazy diskov, inštalátor alebo priečinok. Nič z toho sa nezmení."
        "A file or files" = "Súbor alebo súbory"
        "A folder" = "Priečinok"
        "Looking at what it is…" = "Pozerám, čo to je…"
        "It will work" = "Pôjde to"
        "It should work" = "Asi to pôjde"
        "It will not work" = "Nepôjde to"
        "Somebody has installed and started it this way before." = "Takto to už niekto nainštaloval a spustil."
        "There is a way written down, but nobody has tried it yet." = "Postup je zapísaný, ale nikto ho ešte neskúsil."
        "A disc is missing: nothing here has {file}. Choose all the discs together." = "Chýba disk: nič tu nemá {file}. Vyber všetky disky naraz."
        "It is installed already." = "Už je nainštalované."
        "I do not know this program; the way follows from what it is. Nobody has tried it yet." = "Tento program nepoznám; postup vyplýva z toho, čo je zač. Nikto ho ešte neskúsil."
        "It is a DOS or 16-bit program; their player, DOSBox, is still to come." = "Je to program pre DOS alebo 16-bitový; DOSBox, v ktorom bežia, ešte len príde."
        "{tool} is missing on this computer." = "V tomto počítači chýba {tool}."
        "I cannot take this kind of file yet." = "Takýto súbor zatiaľ vziať neviem."
        "What it is" = "Čo to je"
        "From what" = "Z čoho"
        "How it is packed" = "Ako je zabalené"
        "An InstallShield installer." = "Inštalátor InstallShield."
        "An Inno Setup installer." = "Inštalátor Inno Setup."
        "An NSIS installer." = "Inštalátor NSIS."
        "An archive that unpacks itself." = "Archív, ktorý sa rozbalí sám."
        "A Windows Installer package. It installs itself, without questions." = "Balík Windows Installer. Nainštaluje sa sám, bez otázok."
        "An installer I cannot read. It will run, and you click through it as in Windows." = "Inštalátor, ktorý neviem prečítať. Spustí sa a preklikáš ho ako vo Windows."
        "No installer: it is ready to be copied." = "Bez inštalátora: stačí to skopírovať."
        "I will not run it: I read what it carries directly, which is where old installers fail." = "Nespustím ho: prečítam priamo, čo nesie, lebo práve tam staré inštalátory zlyhávajú."
        "Installing {what}" = "Inštalujem {what}"
        "{what} is running: click through its windows" = "Beží {what}: preklikaj jeho okná"
        "Looking for the program" = "Hľadám program"
        "What it will run in" = "V čom pobeží"
        "the program is from {year}" = "program je z roku {year}"
        "Room on the disk" = "Miesto na disku"
        "{free} free; it needs about {need}" = "{free} voľných; potrebuje asi {need}"
        "May I look on the internet for more about it? Only its name is sent, to Lutris's catalogue. Without that I go on with what is on this computer." = "Smiem o tom zistiť viac na internete? Odošle sa iba názov, do katalógu Lutris. Bez toho pokračujem s tým, čo je v tomto počítači."
        "The internet did not answer." = "Internet neodpovedal."
        "Lutris knows it: others run it on Linux." = "Lutris to pozná: iní to na Linuxe spúšťajú."
        "Lutris does not know it." = "Lutris to nepozná."
        "Find out more on the internet" = "Zistiť viac na internete"
        "Go on offline" = "Pokračovať offline"
        "Go on" = "Pokračovať"
        "A folder of its own: its Windows, its saves and what it says. Removing it removes all of it." = "Vlastný priečinok: jeho Windows, uložené hry a výpisy. Odstránením zmizne všetko."
        "Fenced in" = "V ohrade"
        "It sees the system read-only and, of your home, only its own folder." = "Systém vidí iba na čítanie a z tvojho domova iba vlastný priečinok."
        "With the network" = "So sieťou"
        "Without the network" = "Bez siete"
        "Off unless you play over the network." = "Vypnutá, ak nehráš po sieti."
        "Turn off" = "Vypnúť"
        "Turn on" = "Zapnúť"
        "It did not install" = "Nenainštalovalo sa"
        "Installed. Try it." = "Nainštalované. Vyskúšaj to."
        "Installing…" = "Inštalujem…"
        "Starting…" = "Začínam…"
        "Start it and see whether it works: the menu, a moment of play, the sound. Then tell me how it went." = "Spusti to a pozri, či to funguje: ponuka, chvíľa hry, zvuk. Potom mi povedz, ako to dopadlo."
