        "Open with" = "Otvoriť v programe"
        "More than one screen" = "Viac obrazoviek"
        "Extended, each screen is a desktop of its own. Duplicated, they all show the main one's picture." = "Rozšírené: každá obrazovka je vlastná plocha. Duplikované: všetky ukazujú obraz hlavnej."
        "Extend" = "Rozšíriť"
        "Duplicate" = "Duplikovať"
        "When a notification comes" = "Keď príde upozornenie"
        "Every notification waits in ClockGoo until you have read it or cleared it." = "Každé upozornenie čaká v ClockGoo, kým si ho neprečítaš alebo nezmažeš."
        "Nothing is shown and nothing sounds; notifications wait quietly." = "Nič sa neukáže a nič nezaznie; upozornenia ticho čakajú."
        "Show it in the corner" = "Ukázať ho v rohu"
        "A note for a few seconds above the right end of the bar. A press opens the notifications." = "Lístok na pár sekúnd nad pravým koncom lišty. Klik otvorí upozornenia."
        "Play a sound" = "Prehrať zvuk"
        "A short, quiet tone." = "Krátky, tichý tón."
        "Try it" = "Vyskúšať"
        "This is how a notification looks." = "Takto vyzerá upozornenie."
        "The password is changed." = "Heslo je zmenené."
        "Not changed: the present password was not given." = "Nezmenené: terajšie heslo nebolo zadané."
        "Not changed." = "Nezmenené."
        "Change your password" = "Zmena hesla"
        "Type the new one twice. The system then asks for the present one in its own window." = "Napíš nové dvakrát. Systém si potom vo vlastnom okne vypýta terajšie."
        "New password" = "Nové heslo"
        "New password again" = "Nové heslo ešte raz"
        "Change password" = "Zmeniť heslo"
        "The two do not match." = "Tie dve sa nezhodujú."
        "The same on every screen" = "Rovnaké na každej obrazovke"
        "Only {screen}" = "Iba {screen}"
        "What you choose goes on every screen." = "Čo vyberieš, pôjde na každú obrazovku."
        "What you choose goes on {screen} only; the others keep theirs." = "Čo vyberieš, pôjde iba na {screen}; ostatné si nechajú svoje."
        "Solid colour" = "Plná farba"
        "Slideshow" = "Prezentácia"
        "Describe it" = "Opísať slovami"
        "Choose a picture" = "Výber obrázka"
        "LatteOS's own, and what is in your Pictures and Videos folders. A film moves behind the desktop, silently." = "Vlastné od LatteOS a to, čo máš v priečinkoch Obrázky a Videá. Film sa hýbe za plochou, bez zvuku."
        "Browse…" = "Prehľadávať…"
        "Choose a fit" = "Prispôsobiť obrázok"
        "Fill" = "Vyplniť"
        "Fit" = "Prispôsobiť"
        "Stretch" = "Roztiahnuť"
        "Centre" = "Na stred"
        "Tile" = "Dlaždice"
        "Choose a colour" = "Výber farby"
        "Use this colour" = "Použiť túto farbu"
        "Choose a folder for the slideshow" = "Priečinok pre prezentáciu"
        "Every picture and film in it takes its turn." = "Každý obrázok a film v ňom príde na rad."
        "Change picture every" = "Meniť obrázok každých"
        "6 hours" = "6 hodín"
        "1 day" = "1 deň"
        "Shuffle" = "Náhodné poradie"
        "Start the slideshow" = "Spustiť prezentáciu"
        "Bing's pictures of the last days" = "Obrázky Bingu z posledných dní"
        "Pictures from Wallhaven" = "Obrázky z Wallhavenu"
        "Live wallpapers from MotionBGS" = "Živé tapety z MotionBGS"
        "A press fetches one into your Pictures and puts it behind the desktop." = "Klik ju stiahne do Obrázkov a dá za plochu."
        "Its own picker over the desktop: your library with transitions, scenes of Wallpaper Engine, its downloads and playlists. What you choose there is kept here too." = "Jeho vlastný výber nad plochou: tvoja knižnica s prechodmi, scény Wallpaper Engine, sťahovanie a zoznamy. Čo vyberieš tam, zapamätá sa aj tu."
        "skwd-wall is not installed. With it wallpapers change with a transition and scenes can be shown." = "skwd-wall nie je nainštalovaný. S ním sa tapety menia prechodom a dajú sa ukázať scény."
        "Open skwd-wall" = "Otvoriť skwd-wall"
        "Describe the wallpaper you want" = "Opíš tapetu, akú chceš"
        "A model on this computer looks through your library for pictures that show what you describe. Nothing leaves the computer." = "Model v tomto počítači prejde tvoju knižnicu a nájde obrázky, ktoré ukazujú, čo opíšeš. Z počítača nič neodchádza."
        "This needs skwd-wall with its search model, and AI turned on in the Settings." = "Potrebuje skwd-wall s jeho modelom na hľadanie a zapnutú AI v Nastaveniach."
        "a foggy forest in the morning…" = "hmlistý les ráno…"
        "Look for it" = "Vyhľadať"
        "From the internet" = "Z internetu"
        "A press fetches one into your Pictures and puts it behind the desktop. Bing's are photographs, MotionBGS's are films." = "Klik ju stiahne do Obrázkov a dá za plochu. Z Bingu sú fotografie, z MotionBGS filmy."
        "Search films…" = "Hľadať filmy…"
        "Next desktop background" = "Ďalšie pozadie plochy"
        "From the wallpaper" = "Podľa tapety"
        "its colours, each time it changes" = "jej farby, pri každej zmene"
        "Wallpaper picker" = "Výber tapety"
        "Change wallpaper" = "Zmeniť tapetu"
        "NOW PLAYING" = "PRÁVE HRÁ"
        "Nothing was copied yet" = "Zatiaľ nebolo nič skopírované"
        "Icons" = "Ikony"
        "What files, folders and apps are shown with: on the desktop, in LatteOS's apps and in apps that follow the system." = "Čím sa ukazujú súbory, priečinky a aplikácie: na ploche, v aplikáciách LatteOS a v tých, čo sa riadia systémom."
        "Huge icons" = "Obrovské ikony"
