        "Display settings" = "Nastavenia obrazovky"
        "Personalize" = "Prispôsobiť"
        "Drops" = "Kvapky"
        "Why the last session ended" = "Prečo sa skončila minulá relácia"
        "Copy that as a report" = "Skopírovať to ako správu"
        "The report is on the clipboard" = "Správa je v schránke"
        "This start" = "Tento štart"
        "The start before" = "Predošlý štart"
        "With whyd installed, this also says what the journal recorded." = "S nainštalovaným whyd to povie aj to, čo zapísal žurnál."
        "No crash is recorded." = "Žiadny pád nie je zapísaný."
        "What LatteOS noted when the desktop last ended badly. Copy it to send it to whoever helps." = "Čo si LatteOS zapísal, keď plocha naposledy skončila zle. Skopíruj to a pošli tomu, kto pomáha."
        "Copy the report" = "Skopírovať správu"
        "Login screen" = "Prihlasovacia obrazovka"
        "Under the surface" = "Pod hladinou"
        "A crash is always shown first. Otherwise the headlines of the feeds below." = "Pád sa ukáže vždy ako prvý. Inak titulky zdrojov nižšie."
        "Nothing" = "Nič"
        "News feeds" = "Zdroje noviniek"
        "RSS or Atom addresses, separated by a space. Fetched at most every 15 minutes." = "Adresy RSS alebo Atom oddelené medzerou. Berú sa najviac raz za 15 minút."
        "https://…" = "https://…"
        "Sky and weather" = "Obloha a počasie"
        "No place: the login screen shows no sky and no weather." = "Bez miesta: prihlásenie neukáže ani oblohu, ani počasie."
        "A city, e.g. Vienna" = "Mesto, napr. Viedeň"
        "Find" = "Nájsť"
        "No weather" = "Bez počasia"
        "The language and the keyboard layout are chosen on the login screen itself, with a click." = "Jazyk a rozloženie klávesnice sa vyberajú na samotnom prihlásení, klikom."
        "Time zone" = "Časové pásmo"
        "Type a city or a part of the world." = "Napíš mesto alebo časť sveta."
        "What the desktop and the apps speak. It changes when you sign in the next time." = "Čím hovorí plocha a aplikácie. Zmení sa pri ďalšom prihlásení."
        "Files and folders" = "Súbory a priečinky"
        "Mail" = "Pošta"
        "No app for it is installed." = "Nie je nainštalovaná žiadna aplikácia."
        "Nothing is connected." = "Nič nie je pripojené."
        "Text" = "Text"
        "The app that opens a kind of thing when it is pressed in a folder, a mail or a web page. Press another to make it the one." = "Aplikácia, ktorá otvorí daný druh vecí, keď ho stlačíš v priečinku, v pošte či na webe. Stlač inú a bude to ona."
        "Video" = "Video"
        "Web browser" = "Webový prehliadač"
        "Where it comes from" = "Odkiaľ prichádza"
        "Where the sound goes" = "Kam ide zvuk"
        "in use" = "používa sa"
        "press to use" = "stlač a použije sa"
        "15 minutes" = "15 minút"
        "1 hour" = "1 hodina"
        "1 minute" = "1 minúta"
        "10 minutes" = "10 minút"
        "30 minutes" = "30 minút"
        "5 minutes" = "5 minút"
        "Left alone that long, the session locks; the password opens it again. A window that fills the screen keeps it awake." = "Keď ju tak dlho necháš, relácia sa zamkne; otvorí ju heslo. Okno na celú obrazovku ju drží prebudenú."
        "Lock the session after" = "Zamknúť reláciu po"
        "Never" = "Nikdy"
        "Power profile" = "Profil napájania"
        "Power saver" = "Úsporný"
        "The session also locks before the computer goes to sleep. Win+L locks it at once." = "Relácia sa zamkne aj pred uspaním počítača. Win+L ju zamkne hneď."
        "This computer offers no power profiles." = "Tento počítač profily napájania neponúka."
        "Turn the screens off after" = "Zhasnúť obrazovky po"
        "everything it has" = "všetko, čo v ňom je"
        "for every day" = "na každý deň"
        "quiet and cool" = "tichý a chladný"
        "All settings…" = "Všetky nastavenia…"
        "And in what cup?" = "A do akého pohára?"
        "Clear" = "Číre"
        "Espresso cup" = "Šálka na espresso"
        "Films from your Videos folder, played silently behind the desktop." = "Filmy z priečinka Videá, prehrávané potichu za plochou."
        "Frosted" = "Matné"
        "Glass" = "Sklo"
        "How the drops behave" = "Ako sa kvapky správajú"
        "How windows are arranged" = "Ako sú okná usporiadané"
        "Canvas" = "Canvas"
        "free windows on a desk you zoom out of" = "voľné okná na ploche, ktorú oddiališ"
        "Three zones" = "Tri zóny"
        "for wide screens: a middle and two columns" = "pre široké obrazovky: stred a dva stĺpce"
        "coming" = "pripravuje sa"
        "Places" = "Miesta"
        "PowerGoo and LensGoo are always there. The coffee the drops are made of is under Coffee and cup." = "PowerGoo a LensGoo sú tam vždy. Káva, z ktorej sú kvapky, je v časti Káva a šálka."
        "On the desktop" = "Na ploche"
        "Show it on the desktop" = "Ukázať na ploche"
        "Always there: it belongs to the desktop itself." = "Je tam vždy: patrí k samotnej ploche."
        "A press on BarGoo" = "Klik na BarGoo"
        "Off: the arrangement chosen in Windows stays, and a press on BarGoo only shows the windows." = "Vypnuté: ostane usporiadanie vybrané v časti Okná a klik na BarGoo iba ukáže okná."
        "Window bar (BarGoo)" = "Lišta okien (BarGoo)"
        "Account and power (PowerGoo)" = "Účet a napájanie (PowerGoo)"
        "Quick launch (QuickGoo)" = "Rýchle spúšťanie (QuickGoo)"
        "Apps and devices (QueenGoo)" = "Aplikácie a zariadenia (QueenGoo)"
        "Music and video (MediaGoo)" = "Hudba a video (MediaGoo)"
        "The windows: its head shows how they are arranged, and where windows float they hang beside it as berries. Left: the arrangement, right: the desktop, the wheel: the next window." = "Okná: hlava ukazuje, ako sú usporiadané, a kde okná plávajú, visia vedľa nej ako ikry. Ľavý klik: usporiadanie, pravý: plocha, koliesko: ďalšie okno."
        "The account and the power: sign out, sleep, restart, shut down, the battery and Settings. Right: the performance band." = "Účet a napájanie: odhlásiť, uspať, reštartovať, vypnúť, batéria a Nastavenia. Pravý klik: pás výkonu."
        "The apps you keep at hand, up to eight, on a strip that slides out of it. You add them in LensGoo with the right button." = "Aplikácie poruke, najviac osem, na páske, ktorá sa z nej vysunie. Pridáš ich v LensGoo pravým klikom."
        "The App Manager on the left button, the Device Manager on the right." = "Ľavý klik: Správca aplikácií, pravý: Správca zariadení."
        "On the desktop only while something plays: the cover, play and pause, the next one, the volume on the wheel." = "Na ploche je, iba kým niečo hrá: obal, prehrať a pozastaviť, ďalšia, hlasitosť kolieskom."
        "A press on BarGoo changes the arrangement" = "Klik na BarGoo mení usporiadanie"
        "left: the windows · wheel: next window · right: show desktop" = "ľavý: okná · koliesko: ďalšie okno · pravý: ukázať plochu"
        "LatteOS's own, and what is in your Pictures folder." = "Vlastné od LatteOS a to, čo máš v priečinku Obrázky."
        "Left alone they fall asleep, the weather outside shows on the surface, playful ones play." = "Keď ich necháš, zaspia, na hladine sa ukáže počasie vonku a hravé sa hrajú."
        "Live backgrounds" = "Živé pozadia"
        "Lively" = "Živé správanie"
        "Meanwhile it is done here:" = "Zatiaľ sa to robí tu:"
        "Milky" = "Mliečne"
        "Mocha cup" = "Šálka na mokku"
        "Open the Device Manager" = "Otvoriť Správcu zariadení"
        "Porcelain" = "Porcelán"
        "Put a film (.mp4, .webm, .mkv) in your Videos folder, or in a folder Wallpapers in it, and it shows here." = "Daj film (.mp4, .webm, .mkv) do priečinka Videá alebo do priečinka Wallpapers v ňom a ukáže sa tu."
        "Ripples lift the drops and the edge gives under them." = "Vlnky kvapky nadvihnú a okraj sa pod nimi poddá."
        "Search settings…" = "Hľadať nastavenie…"
        "Smoked" = "Dymové"
        "The coffee is what the drops on the edge of the screen are made of: more water makes it clearer, more milk lighter." = "Káva je to, z čoho sú kvapky na okraji obrazovky: viac vody ju robí priezračnejšou, viac mlieka svetlejšou."
        "The cup is what the windows are made of." = "Šálka je to, z čoho sú okná."
        "The drops are glass with coffee in it. With the graphics card drawing by the processor they stay plain coffee." = "Kvapky sú zo skla s kávou vnútri. Pri kreslení procesorom ostávajú obyčajnou kávou."
        "Windows of glass" = "Okná zo skla"
        "The windows are glass too, where the graphics card can: that is the cup's own look, apart from the drops." = "Aj okná sú zo skla, kde to grafická karta zvládne: je to vzhľad šálky, nezávislý od kvapiek."
        "The glass of the side panels" = "Sklo bočných panelov"
        "The surface bends" = "Hladina sa prehýba"
        "This page is not in LatteOS yet." = "Táto stránka v LatteOS ešte nie je."
        "WHAT CAN BE SET HERE NOW" = "ČO SA TU DÁ NASTAVIŤ UŽ TERAZ"
        "What coffee would you like?" = "Akú si dáte kávu?"
        "What is behind a window shows through its side panel, blurred. Where the graphics card cannot blur, the panel is solid." = "To, čo je za oknom, presvitá cez jeho bočný panel, rozmazané. Kde grafická karta rozmazať nevie, je panel plný."
        "Drops on the desktop" = "Kvapky na ploche"
        "PowerGoo and LensGoo are always there. Putting the drops back in their places is in PowerGoo › Settings on the desktop itself; the coffee they are made of is under Coffee and cup." = "PowerGoo a LensGoo sú tam vždy. Vrátenie kvapiek na miesto je v PowerGoo › Nastavenia priamo na ploche; káva, z ktorej sú, je v časti Káva a šálka."
        "an endless strip, nothing is put away" = "nekonečný pás, nič sa neodkladá"
        "as on Windows" = "ako vo Windows"
        "dark" = "tmavá"
        "light" = "svetlá"
        "warm brown" = "teplá hnedá"
        "windows share the screen" = "okná sa delia o obrazovku"
        "Software" = "Softvér"
        "Apps" = "Aplikácie"
        "Startup and background" = "Spúšťanie a na pozadí"
        "Default apps" = "Predvolené aplikácie"
        "Data" = "Dáta"
        "Backup and restore" = "Zálohovanie a obnova"
        "Cloud and sync" = "Cloud a synchronizácia"
        "Hardware" = "Hardvér"
        "Performance and graphics" = "Výkon a grafika"
        "Bluetooth and devices" = "Bluetooth a zariadenia"
        "Printers and scanners" = "Tlačiarne a skenery"
