        "Sign out" = "Odhlásiť sa"
        "Signed in" = "Prihlásené"
        "With an account, the service's official tool answers, signed in once in the terminal. Which of them LensGoo offers is set in Settings › Launcher." = "S účtom odpovedá oficiálny nástroj služby, do ktorého sa raz prihlásiš v termináli. Ktoré z nich ponúka LensGoo, sa nastavuje v Nastaveniach › Spúšťač."
        "ACCOUNTS" = "ÚČTY"
        "(stopped)" = "(zastavené)"
        "Welcome, {n}" = "Vitaj, {n}"
        "Where shall we start?" = "Kde začneme?"
        "We can start whenever you like." = "Môžeme začať, keď budeš chcieť."
        "Morning, what are we building?" = "Dobré ráno, čo budeme stavať?"
        "Afternoon, what are we building?" = "Dobrý deň, čo budeme stavať?"
        "Evening, what are we building?" = "Dobrý večer, čo budeme stavať?"
        "Hi, what can I do for you?" = "Ahoj, čo pre vás môžem urobiť?"
        "Copilot uses AI. Check for mistakes." = "Copilot používa AI. Skontroluj, či sa nemýli."
        "Credits (week)" = "Kredity (týždeň)"
        "What do you want to build?" = "Čo chceš postaviť?"
        "Message DeepSeek" = "Napíšte správu pre DeepSeek"
        "Thinking" = "Premýšľanie"
        "Deep thinking" = "Hlboké myslenie"
        "Ask Copilot" = "Opýtaj sa Copilota"
        "Ask Le Chat" = "Opýtaj sa Le Chat"
        "Credits (month)" = "Kredity (mesiac)"
        "Suggestions in the editor" = "Návrhy v editore"
        "{n} questions through Lens this month" = "{n} otázok cez Lens tento mesiac"
        "The account's quota is not told here; the service's own page shows it." = "Kvótu účtu sem služba nehlási; ukazuje ju jej stránka."
        "Effort" = "Úsilie"
        "Through your account" = "Cez tvoj účet"
        "Its limits are shown on the service's own page." = "Limity ukazuje stránka služby."
        "To make, grow or move partitions we suggest KDE Partition Manager or GParted. They need the administrator's password and are installed as packages of the system, not from Flathub." = "Na vytvorenie, zväčšenie či presun oddielov odporúčame KDE Partition Manager alebo GParted. Potrebujú heslo správcu a inštalujú sa ako balíky systému, nie z Flathubu."
        "Before the closer look" = "Pred podrobnou kontrolou"
        "It knocks on the well-known ports of every device on the network, gently, to find which services answer and what is weak. It changes nothing and logs in nowhere." = "Opatrne zaklope na bežné porty každého zariadenia v sieti, aby zistila, ktoré služby odpovedajú a čo je slabé. Nič nemení a nikam sa neprihlasuje."
        "A security program on another computer (ESET, Norton, Windows Defender…) may report it as a port scan: that is this look. Check only your own network." = "Bezpečnostný program na inom počítači (ESET, Norton, Windows Defender…) to môže ohlásiť ako mapovanie portov: je to táto kontrola. Kontroluj iba vlastnú sieť."
        "Not now" = "Teraz nie"
        "Map" = "Mapa"
        "A router that does not answer" = "Router, ktorý neodpovedá"
        "Your provider" = "Tvoj poskytovateľ"
        "This network's router" = "Router tejto siete"
        "A router on the way" = "Router po ceste"
        "this computer" = "tento počítač"
        "Check closely to find the way out: every router between this computer and the internet." = "Skontroluj podrobne a ukáže sa cesta von: každý router medzi týmto počítačom a internetom."
        "Ordinary switches pass everything through and cannot be seen; managed ones will show once they are asked (SNMP, LLDP)." = "Bežné switche všetko len prepúšťajú a nedajú sa uvidieť; spravovateľné sa ukážu, keď sa ich spýtame (SNMP, LLDP)."
        "{n} free" = "{n} voľných"
        "Disks and devices" = "Disky a zariadenia"
        "unused" = "nevyužité"
        "Unused room" = "Nevyužité miesto"
        "locked" = "zamknuté"
        "{used} of {all}" = "{used} z {all}"
        "Unused room is part of a disk no partition takes: nothing can be kept there until it gets one." = "Nevyužité miesto je časť disku, ktorú nezaberá žiadny oddiel: kým ho nedostane, nedá sa tam nič uložiť."
        "as of {n}" = "údaj z {n}"
        "The firewall guards this computer ({zone})" = "Firewall chráni tento počítač ({zone})"
        "The firewall is off" = "Firewall je vypnutý"
        "Other devices can reach whatever runs here. Turn it on: sudo systemctl enable --now firewalld" = "Iné zariadenia sa dostanú ku všetkému, čo tu beží. Zapni ho: sudo systemctl enable --now firewalld"
        "Other devices may reach: {list}" = "Iné zariadenia sa smú pripojiť k: {list}"
        "as the zone comes; changes made to it are not shown" = "podľa predvolenej zóny; jej úpravy tu nevidno"
        "A new device on the network" = "Nové zariadenie v sieti"
        "Unknown device" = "Neznáme zariadenie"
        "Radar" = "Radar"
        "List" = "Zoznam"
        "{n} to fix" = "{n} na opravu"
        "From the router" = "Od routera"
        "As it came; nothing is filtered." = "Ako prišlo; nič sa nefiltruje."
        "Quick, and keeps no record of what you look up." = "Rýchly a nezaznamenáva, čo hľadáš."
        "Blocks addresses known to spread malware." = "Blokuje adresy, o ktorých sa vie, že šíria škodlivý softvér."
        "Blocks ads and trackers too, for every app at once." = "Blokuje aj reklamy a sledovanie, pre všetky aplikácie naraz."
        "Quick; Google sees what you look up." = "Rýchly; Google vidí, čo hľadáš."
        "PROTECTION (NAME SERVERS)" = "OCHRANA (DNS)"
        "Changing… the network is away for a moment." = "Mením… sieť na chvíľu vypadne."
        "It applies to this computer only; for every device at home, the same can be set in the router." = "Platí iba pre tento počítač; pre všetky zariadenia doma sa to isté dá nastaviť v routeri."
        "Open its settings page" = "Otvoriť jeho stránku nastavení"
        "AirPlay" = "AirPlay"
        "Answers on: {list}" = "Odpovedá na: {list}"
        "Camera" = "Kamera"
        "Camera picture" = "Obraz z kamery"
        "Cast to it" = "Premietať naň"
        "Check closely" = "Skontrolovať podrobne"
        "Network safety" = "Bezpečnosť siete"
        "Nothing weak was found." = "Nenašlo sa nič slabé."
        "Play music and video on it" = "Púšťať naň hudbu a video"
        "Prints" = "Tlačí"
        "Remote access" = "Vzdialený prístup"
        "Settings page" = "Stránka nastavení"
        "Shared files" = "Zdieľané súbory"
        "Shares music and video" = "Zdieľa hudbu a video"
        "WHAT IT CAN DO" = "ČO VIE"
        "of 100; what to do is below" = "zo 100; čo robiť, je nižšie"
        "Telnet is open: passwords travel unencrypted" = "Telnet je otvorený: heslá idú nešifrované"
        "Turn Telnet off on the device; use SSH or its app instead." = "Vypni na zariadení Telnet; používaj SSH alebo jeho aplikáciu."
        "FTP is open: files and passwords travel unencrypted" = "FTP je otvorené: súbory aj heslá idú nešifrované"
        "Turn FTP off, or use SFTP." = "Vypni FTP, alebo používaj SFTP."
        "Remote desktop (RDP) is open to the network" = "Vzdialená plocha (RDP) je otvorená do siete"
        "Allow remote desktop only when needed, with a strong password." = "Vzdialenú plochu povoľ iba keď treba, so silným heslom."
        "VNC remote screen is open to the network" = "Vzdialená obrazovka VNC je otvorená do siete"
        "Give VNC a password, or turn it off." = "Daj VNC heslo, alebo ho vypni."
        "An MQTT broker answers without encryption" = "Server MQTT odpovedá bez šifrovania"
        "Give the broker a password and TLS, or keep it on a separate network." = "Daj serveru heslo a TLS, alebo ho drž v oddelenej sieti."
        "Old Windows file sharing (NetBIOS) is on" = "Je zapnuté staré zdieľanie súborov Windows (NetBIOS)"
        "Turn NetBIOS off where SMB alone will do." = "Vypni NetBIOS tam, kde stačí samotné SMB."
        "The camera gives its picture to anyone on the network, without a password" = "Kamera dá obraz komukoľvek v sieti, bez hesla"
        "Set a password for the camera's stream in its app." = "Nastav heslo pre obraz kamery v jej aplikácii."
        "UPnP is on in the router: any device can open a door to the internet by itself" = "Router má zapnuté UPnP: ktorékoľvek zariadenie si samo otvorí dvere do internetu"
        "Turn UPnP off in the router's settings, unless a game console needs it." = "Vypni UPnP v nastaveniach routera, ak ho nepotrebuje herná konzola."
        "Its settings page is not encrypted (http)" = "Jeho stránka nastavení nie je šifrovaná (http)"
        "Use the device's app, or turn on https if it has it." = "Používaj aplikáciu zariadenia, alebo zapni https, ak ho má."
        "A device not seen on this network before" = "Zariadenie, ktoré v tejto sieti ešte nebolo"
        "If you do not know it, name it, or block it in the router." = "Ak ho nepoznáš, pomenuj ho, alebo ho zablokuj v routeri."
