        "LatteOS skill for the agents" = "Skill LatteOS pre agentov"
        "What Claude Code, Codex and Gemini know about LatteOS when you ask them for help with this computer: how it is built, what may be changed and how, and that they plan first and ask. Add your own rules at the end." = "Čo vedia Claude Code, Codex a Gemini o LatteOS, keď ich požiadaš o pomoc s týmto počítačom: ako je postavený, čo sa smie meniť a ako, a že najprv navrhnú plán a opýtajú sa. Na koniec môžeš dopísať vlastné pravidlá."
        "Restore LatteOS's own" = "Obnoviť pôvodný od LatteOS"
        "Do it for me" = "Urob to za mňa"
        "The agent opens in a terminal, looks around, makes a plan and asks you before it changes anything. It knows LatteOS from its skill (Instructions)." = "Agent sa otvorí v termináli, porozhliadne sa, navrhne plán a pred každou zmenou sa ťa opýta. LatteOS pozná zo svojho skillu (Pokyny)."
        "What should it do? For example: my disk is full, make room" = "Čo má urobiť? Napríklad: disk je plný, urob miesto"
