        "Small and quick on any processor: the micro-agents, a command from a sentence, translating (latte-lab: 2–5 s)." = "Malý a rýchly na akomkoľvek procesore: mikro-agenti, príkaz z vety, preklady (latte-lab: 2–5 s)."
