        "None is chosen: LatteOS does not choose for you. Crashes and “Do it for me” go to the one you choose." = "Žiadny nie je vybraný: LatteOS za teba nevyberá. Pády programov a „Urob to za mňa“ dostane ten, ktorého vyberieš."
        "Not told for:" = "Bez upozornenia pre:"
        "Nothing leaves this computer." = "Nič neodíde z počítača."
        "Small agents that help LatteOS. Each one can be turned off: then it stops offering itself, and what it did can still be asked for by hand." = "Malí agenti, ktorí pomáhajú LatteOS. Každého môžeš vypnúť: prestane sa ponúkať, no o to isté ho môžeš stále požiadať ručne."
        "Small tasks" = "Drobné úlohy"
        "The AI layer of LatteOS is off: none of these asks any AI now." = "Vrstva AI v LatteOS je vypnutá: nikto z nich sa teraz AI nepýta."
        "Through Claude Code: some ten seconds" = "Cez Claude Code: asi desať sekúnd"
        "WHAT HELPS" = "ČO POMÁHA"
